{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>周日是重陽節，消防處將利用無人機及人工智能(AI)，偵測及預防山火。<br/></p><p>消防處指周六起設立高級指揮室，並部署額外人手，到12個山火風險相對高的地點巡邏，包括元朗井坑山、上水華山等，期望能盡快撲滅早期火種。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FSD-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ngzJcRfsp61792138007.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>處方今年亦會繼續使用無人機遙距空中巡邏，並透過人工智能識別山火煙霧。另外亦有無人機配備載水裝置，需要時會投放水彈撲火。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:21:05.297331+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:37:45.902770+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:18:00.158565+00:00","content_hash":"4b62c35d3ab77359aab7d6dc9e3433e132d7379763158ae1e94c55fdb0dafd6f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}